 um workshops for the public\, and thanks in part to a grant from the Great
 er Worcester Community Foundation\, they're here! Join us on Nov 10 for th
 e first of 5 workshops. Pay what you can Learn the foundations of West Afr
 ican Drumming from Drum Master Issa Coulibaly in a fun\, social environmen
 t. Engage your mind and body while learning about African cultures through
