BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hands-On: Tagliatelle Alla Bolognese
DTSTART:20261110T000000
DTEND:20261203T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T191221Z
UID:f5630841b78df0dbe1dc026bf5cf4d@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:It’s time to get your hands messy! In our hands-on format\, 
 you’ll be diving right in and making our dish with ingredients prepared 
 by our Eataly kitchens. Our Scuola Chef will prepare a curated antipasto f
 or you to taste in the class. You then get to enjoy your culinary creation
  straight out of the burner. Originally from Bologna\, this decadent sauce
  is cooked low and slow until the sauce is velvety smooth. Made from groun
 d beef and pork\, tomato passata\, red wine\, and sauteed vegetables. In t
 his class\, you’ll make a Tagliatelle alla Bolognese from scratch. Sourc
 es: Meet Boston Event page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/hands-on%3a-t
 agliatelle-alla-bolognese/94217/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Nor
 thborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.
 ics\nSource page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/hands-on%3a-tagliatelle
 -alla-bolognese/94217/
LOCATION:Eataly Boston\, Prudential Center 800 Boylston Street\, Boston\, 
 MA\, 02199
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/hands-on%3a-tagliatelle-alla-bolognes
 e/94217/
