BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Riaces de Amor
DTSTART:20261111T000000
DTEND:20261111T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T191221Z
UID:c35604e5b6b0882662d854ed3818cc@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:From this presenter: On display: November 3-22 Raíces de Amor
  is a celebration of the stories\, traditions\, relationships\, and experi
 ences that shape our sense of belonging. Bringing together artists whose w
 ork explores family histories\, migration and diaspora\, cultural traditio
 ns\, spirituality\, chosen family\, queer kinship\, resilience\, and memor
 y\, the exhibition reflects on the many ways we carry our roots with us. T
 he exhibition creates space to honor those who came before us while recogn
 izing the communities and relationships that continue to shape who we are.
  Through personal stories\, cultural traditions\, and creative interpretat
 ions of home\, the participating artists explore how identity is inherited
 \, transformed\, and reimagined across generations. -- Follow them: @flors
 show_arte #Raicedeamor Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page:
  https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/riaces-de-amor/31079/\n\nEvents N
 ear Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallb
 ack from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentra
 lma.org/event/riaces-de-amor/31079/
LOCATION:Jean McDonough Arts Center\, 20 Franklin St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 0
 1608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/riaces-de-amor/31079/
END:VEVENT
