BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Au: Origins Unearthed Opening Lecture
DTSTART:20261112T000000
DTEND:20261112T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T191221Z
UID:c3788d56b6fee7fc6423efa1b6b0f4@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:A new Exhibit Spotlight\, Au: Origins Unearthed\, in the Earth
  & Planetary Sciences Gallery of the Harvard Museum of Natural History\, e
 xamines the global impacts of gold extraction—from illegal artisanal min
 ing and mercury contamination to emerging efforts to promote traceability 
 and responsible sourcing. This interdisciplinary program opens with a look
  at scientific research on mercury contamination caused by illegal gold mi
 ning in Amazonian rivers\, exploring its effects on Indigenous communities
 \, waterways\, soils\, and forests. A panel discussion will follow\, featu
 ring jewelry designers\, activists\, and legal experts working in Colombia
 \, Brazil\, and the Democratic Republic of the Congo. Together\, they will
  consider pathways toward more ethical and responsible mining\, systems th
 at enable companies and consumers to trace gold to its source\, and tools 
 for identifying illegal mining. A reception will follow in the Earth & Pla
 netary Sciences Gallery of the Harvard Museum of Natural History. Free eve
 nt parking is available with registration. Register by November 11 to rece
 ive parking registration instructions. Presented by the Mineralogical & Ge
 ological Museum at Harvard University\, the Harvard Museum of Natural Hist
 ory\, and the Harvard Museums of Science & Culture. LEARN MORE Sources: Me
 et Boston Event page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/au%3a-origins-unear
 thed-opening-lecture/93951/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northbor
 ough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\n
 Source page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/au%3a-origins-unearthed-open
 ing-lecture/93951/
LOCATION:Geological Lecture Hall\, Geological Lecture Hall 24 Oxford Stree
 t\, Cambridge\, MA\, 02138
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/au%3a-origins-unearthed-opening-lectu
 re/93951/
END:VEVENT
