BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Family Fun: Holiday Gelato Cake
DTSTART:20261114T000000
DTEND:20261212T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T191221Z
UID:2d08357f90357860ac397a38aa1866@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:It’s time to get your hands messy! In our hands-on format\, 
 you’ll be diving right in and making our dish with ingredients prepared 
 by our Eataly kitchens. You will then get to enjoy the dish made in advanc
 e by our Scuola Chef\, and you can take your culinary creation home with y
 ou! This delightful twist on the traditional Florentine zuccotto highlight
 s its signature dome shape and rich\, creamy filling. Soft sponge cake is 
 gently brushed with a flavorful syrup—often infused with liqueur or espr
 esso—and then molded to create the classic semicircle. Inside\, you’ll
  layer a luxurious ricotta- or mascarpone‑based cream dotted with chocol
 ate chips or candied fruit for a dessert that is both elegant and comforti
 ng. In this class\, you’ll assemble your own zuccotto using pre‑prepar
 ed components\, learning how to build\, fill\, and finish this iconic Ital
 ian dessert. Sources: Meet Boston Event page: https://www.meetboston.com/e
