DESCRIPTION:In Fire and Water\, flutist Bonnie Cochran and guitarist Fred 
 Springer explore the elemental forces that shape both nature and human exp
 erience. Featuring works by Miyagi\, Mahoney\, McFadden\, and Dowland\, th
 e program reflects on fire and water as symbols of creation\, destruction
 \, renewal\, turbulence\, and tranquility. Through shifting musical landsc
 apes\, the concert invites listeners to consider the powerful currents tha
 t flow both around us and within us. Free Admission YouTube: @bonniecochra
 n YouTube: @fspringerguitar This program is supported in part by a grant f
 rom the Marlborough Cultural Council\, a local agency which is supported b
 y the Mass Cultural Council\, a state agency. Sources: Discover Central Ma
