BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ghostlight on the Fifth: A Staged Reading
DTSTART:20261115T000000
DTEND:20261115T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T191221Z
UID:4e57585a162f3c71685e63852b4a64@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Studio Theatre Worcester is proud to present a staged reading 
 of Ghostlight on the Fifth on November 15th at 6:00pm. This tremendous new
  work by playwright Carlos Fruzzetti is in development as part of our Firs
 t Stages initiative. This public-facing staged reading\, directed by Jada 
 Lawyer\, is a crucial checkpoint in this play's development as it provides
  the playwright with insights from the audience perspective. We also invit
 e you to join us following the reading for a brief 30min feedback session
 \, moderated by our Producer and Dramaturg\, Amanda Tafeen. SYNOPSIS It’
 s midnight on the fifth of April in a rehearsal space they call Delirium. 
 Ghostlight is a young\, ambitious rock band that’s taken residence here.
  Tonight\, they’re on the verge of collapse. One of them is leaving. One
  of them is spiraling. One can’t play his guitar anymore. Through the ni
 ght\, the space oscillates back and forth between the murmurings\, melodie
 s\, and memories of this haunted band as they attempt to overcome their st
 ruggles. When the sun rises\, we’re left to wonder what is real\, what i
 s memory\, what is neither masked as both\, and what’s the difference? S
 ources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercen
 tralma.org/event/ghostlight-on-the-fifth%3a-a-staged-reading/31080/\n\nEve
 nts Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local 
 fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discoverc
 entralma.org/event/ghostlight-on-the-fifth%3a-a-staged-reading/31080/
LOCATION:WCUW Radio Front Room\, 910 Main Street\, Worcester\, MA\, 01610
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/ghostlight-on-the-fifth%3a-a-s
 taged-reading/31080/
END:VEVENT
